                       "description":  "The graph traversal follows the knowledge graph: UIElement ← InteractedWith ← TaskRun → BelongsTo → Workflow, with DetectedDuring edges connecting to findings. Each node type\u0027s color communicates its role in the causal chain: blue elements are UI targets, purple runs are execution instances, green workflows are the automation definition, orange findings are discovered issues, cyan fixes are attempted solutions. This lets users trace \u0027why did this element fail?\u0027 back to its root cause.",
