                       "description":  "CrossRunPatternsPanel accepts an optional workflowName prop to filter patterns. When no workflow is selected, all patterns are shown. The panel uses useCrossRunPatterns() hook with 30s stale time and 60s refetch interval. StepProvenanceTimeline requires a workflowId prop and is disabled when empty. SelectorDecayChart requires an elementId prop. FailureChainViewer requires an elementId prop.",
