    "description":  "Cross-Run Analytics components — CrossRunPatternsPanel, StepProvenanceTimeline, SelectorDecayChart, and FailureChainViewer. Used within the Reflection Dashboard and element detail views. CrossRunPatternsPanel shows recurring_finding and fix_oscillation patterns from the knowledge graph\u0027s cross_run_patterns table. StepProvenanceTimeline shows which pipeline agent generated each step with UI Bridge interaction overlays. SelectorDecayChart tracks element reliability over time. FailureChainViewer traces graph paths from UI elements through task runs to workflows, findings, and fixes.",
